	(text "Ilim = 1030000/Rlim\n(Switching current peak, not output current peak)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 272.034 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "0ab13bbd-e215-472a-9130-328dc8d6a41f")
	)
	(text "LONG-PRESS TIMER\nt = R335 * C312 * -ln(1 - V_T+ / V_button)\nV_T+ ~ 3.5V (74HC14 at 6V VCC)\nV_button = 74HC14 VCC\n(SW302 drives trigger channel C and D for\nconsistent voltage in for timer, regardless\nof pwr_vin)\n\nCurrent values: 220k * 22uF\nAt V_button = 6V (USB): t ~ 7 sec\n\n74HC14 powered directly from 6V switcher output\nfor solid Q308 gate drive and predictable rail\ncollapse behavior.\n\nDecrease R335 for shorter trigger time.\n\nC312 discharging through R336\ndetermines this length\n(Though R336 too log will prevent \noff trigger is less than 1.5x R322)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 382.016 165.354 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "159df1ae-647f-489b-9573-2704c1ec7334")
	)
	(text "Read the battery voltage via ADC.\nDivider network to get voltage within ADC range.\nMOSFET to disconnect the battery when device is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.706 119.888 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "1ed78ad7-7d5d-4bc4-9a7c-df5b1d5cf3a9")
	)
	(text "These resistor bypasses all power button logic\nand just runs the switchmode all the time\nor when conencted over USB (Mostly for dev)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 278.13 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "25275f75-7602-43b5-b8ce-00ce5d1b0abb")
	)
	(text "This cap\nholds pwr_en\nup until the\nMCU can boot"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 351.79 38.354 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2b693ec5-90e9-46a0-85a1-0db496c3fc6f")
	)
	(text "-=Power On/Disable Blocks=-"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.446 16.002 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.032 2.032)
				(thickness 0.4064)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5e08d7b3-5de8-48eb-b98a-f8ad6ef2b719")
	)
	(text "The switchmode power supply will just\ndeliver vin=vout when not enabled (not 0)\n\nSo use an enhancement p-fet to disable output\nunless PWR_EN is enabled.\n\n(This should also minimise power use when off)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 327.66 211.074 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5ebce4b2-d565-4c2c-8444-a760dcfc43a3")
	)
	(text "-=Load Connect/Disconnect=-"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 242.57 193.802 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.032 2.032)
				(thickness 0.4064)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "66cacc8e-5699-4955-8322-4f368cc57772")
	)
	(text "Vout = 1.2 * (1 + Rfbt/Rfbb)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 183.134 267.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "701d3ec3-d673-4cbd-9a6f-2d1b07122678")
	)
	(text "Optional bridge to disable soft-off. \n(Useful for flashing initial firmware)\nPopulate R333 to make permenant"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 296.672 83.82 0)
		(effects
