	)
	(text "SpecterDIY drives PWR_HOLD2\nhigh immediately at boot.\n\nDrives it low to request power off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 263.652 61.468 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d6737fe4-b064-444d-abcf-2244c6907463")
	)
	(text "Normal On Button function"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 282.956 23.876 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d732d3a2-b4a5-4346-a27d-442f5f2c1086")
	)
	(text "Hardware long-press force-off: \nholding SW302 for ~6 seconds charges an\nRC timer through a Schmitt trigger, \nwhich fires a MOSFET to pull PWR_HOLD2\nlow and kill the rail - independent of MCU state, \nfor recovering from firmware hangs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 268.224 180.086 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e2586bc2-cf4e-46a4-82f2-e678117a96d3")
	)
	(text "A basic TPS61089 Design, straigh off the TI Reference tool.\n\nValues rounded to nearest \"JLCPCB\" basic part value."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 66.802 203.962 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e749f81a-b3eb-4c9e-b5be-aa59c37f55a3")
	)
	(text "Rprog Charge Current Setting\nRPROG(k-ohm) IBAT(mA)\n10		130\n5		250\n4		300\n3		400\n2		580\n1.66	690\n1.5		780\n1.33	900\n1.2 	1000\n\nSpecter + QR scanner can draw about ~600ma, \nso charge at 900ma to avoid overloading some USB-C ports that can only deliver 1.5a"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.842 169.164 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f167ad2b-2bdf-4871-a668-6601dac334b6")
	)
